Modifications (AGPL section 5(a))
---------------------------------

Changes relative to Vikunja, made since 2026-09-25 (independent
development, without merging upstream changes, since 2026-09-30):

  - Liquid-glass user interface
  - Mobile app shell
  - Frontend polish
  - Rebrand to Fenster
  - CI and Docker release setup

The full history of changes is available in the git log of the repository.

